Common Garage Door Problems
Garage doors contain many moving parts that naturally wear over time. Some of the most common issues include:
    • Broken or stretched garage door springs
    • Garage door opener failures
    • Bent or misaligned tracks
    • Worn rollers and hinges
    • Frayed or damaged cables
    • Garage doors stuck open or closed
    • Noisy or uneven door movement
